    {
      "type": "volkovlabs-form-panel",
      "title": "Refuel storage",
      "description": "Books gas INTO a tank as a DELIVERY row on the fuel ledger, through the tickerplant like any other tick. A fresh stack shows every plant at zero because nothing publishes a DELIVERY on its own - physical is sum DELIVERY - sum BURN - so nothing can be offered until gas is booked in here. Deliver adds the quantity; Fill to capacity tops the tank up to its fuelcap and ignores the quantity. Plant = ALL fills every tank, and only works with Fill. Rejected if the delivery would overfill; the panels refresh on the dashboard's 30s interval.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "grafana"
      },
